{"id":"vod_bf_22048","vodId":"22048","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"猫眼三姐妹第二季","name_cn":"猫眼三姐妹第二季","date":"1984-01-01","year":"1984","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-23/d885d121a2c2027f3c15dc3494c71ccd.jpg"},"summary":"猫眼三姐妹是专门窃取美术作品的盗贼集团，她们作案时总会留下带有猫眼三姐妹字样的卡片。被猫眼三姐妹所盗的美术作品都属于她们失散多年的父亲海因茨（一位著名的艺术收藏家）所拥有。犬鸣警察署刑警内海俊夫负责调查猫眼三姐妹的案子，但是逮捕行动却一次又一次因猫眼三姐妹逍遥法外而失败。来生瞳是内海俊夫的女友，经营一家同样名为“猫眼”的咖啡厅。内海俊夫却不知道，来生瞳即是猫眼三姐妹之一……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 01:53:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":37,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidierji/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/maoyansanjiemeidi